## Limitations

- Scanned (image-only) PDFs have no extractable text. An ATS cannot read them either, so export a text-based PDF or upload a DOCX.
- The score is an AI estimate, not the output of any specific commercial ATS. Use it as guidance, not a guarantee.
- Your resume is sent to the Gemini API for analysis. Don't upload documents you aren't comfortable sharing.

